{"ID":"20230928085526-vewt6nz","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230928085526-vewt6nz","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928085526-vewt6nz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928085536-qjjs3j5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928085545-0hz9g8o\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928085536-qjjs3j5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"哑门穴","type":"doc","updated":"20230928085545"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230928085536-qjjs3j5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085536-qjjs3j5","updated":"20230928085536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"哑门穴，位于风府以下，两者只差半寸，失声者可采取针刺哑门；"}]},{"ID":"20230928085536-zf96saj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085536-zf96saj","updated":"20230928085536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可针禁灸；灸哑门一灸就让人变哑巴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928085536-b8pe9la","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085536-b8pe9la","updated":"20230928085536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"哑门穴，督脉阳维脉会道，入系舌本；"}]},{"ID":"20230928085536-xv158i1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085536-xv158i1","updated":"20230928085536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"患者向枕而躺，针刺哑门对着舌根的方向往里刺，针下的很深，扎到正位时，病人舌头会吐出；如图，勿轻易下针；"}]},{"ID":"20230928085536-zoqme7a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085536-zoqme7a","updated":"20230928085536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（哑门下针时候，针尖对着舌根的方向。下到已经到脊椎骨旁，已经碰到头椎。到位的时候，病人舌头会吐出来。哑门专治声音都发不出来。）"}]},{"ID":"20230928085537-srh80no","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085537-srh80no"}},{"ID":"20230928085545-0hz9g8o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085545-0hz9g8o","updated":"20230928085545"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20230928085545-50srxbf.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]}